wh40k-options-world-effects = World visual effects
wh40k-options-world-glow = Soft fixture glow
wh40k-options-world-glow-tooltip = Adds a compact halo and haze to actual light fixtures without copying the image. Tubes emit directional haze, while round lamps emit radial haze; walls block both.
wh40k-options-contact-shadows = Contact shadows
wh40k-options-contact-shadows-tooltip = Adds small soft shadows beneath characters, furniture, machinery, and other floor-standing objects. Disable to reduce rendering cost.
